n Pooling for All Applications","target":"#23-use-connection-pooling-for-all-applications","line":13},{"title":"Use Prepared Statements Correctly with Pooling","target":"#24-use-prepared-statements-correctly-with-pooling","line":14},{"title":"Security & RLS","target":"#security-rls","line":16},{"title":"Apply Principle of Least Privilege","target":"#31-apply-principle-of-least-privilege","line":17},{"title":"Enable Row Level Security for Multi-Tenant Data","target":"#32-enable-row-level-security-for-multi-tenant-data","line":18},{"title":"Optimize RLS Policies for Performance","target":"#33-optimize-rls-policies-for-performance","line":19},{"title":"Schema Design","target":"#schema-design","line":21},{"title":"Choose Appropriate Data Types","target":"#41-choose-appropriate-data-types","line":22},{"title":"Index Foreign Key Columns","target":"#42-index-foreign-key-columns","line":23},{"title":"Partition Large Tables for Better Performance","target":"#43-partition-large-tables-for-better-performance","line":24},{"title":"Select Optimal Primary Key Strategy","target":"#44-select-optimal-primary-key-strategy","line":25},{"title":"Use Lowercase Identifiers for Compatibility","target":"#45-use-lowercase-identifiers-for-compatibility","line":26},{"title":"Concurrency & Locking","target":"#concurrency-locking","line":28},{"title":"Keep Transactions Short to Reduce Lock Contention","target":"#51-keep-transactions-short-to-reduce-lock-contention","line":29},{"title":"Prevent Deadlocks with Consistent Lock Ordering","target":"#52-prevent-deadlocks-with-consistent-lock-ordering","line":30},{"title":"Use Advisory Locks for Application-Level Locking","target":"#53-use-advisory-locks-for-application-level-locking","line":31},{"title":"Use SKIP LOCKED for Non-Blocking Queue Processing","target":"#54-use-skip-locked-for-non-blocking-queue-processing","line":32},{"title":"Data Access Patterns","target":"#data-access-patterns","line":34},{"title":"Batch INSERT Statements for Bulk Data